|---------|-------------------|---------|
| `@scure/bip39` | — | Mnemonic generation, `mnemonicToSeedSync`, `entropyToMnemonic` |
| `@scure/bip32` | — | `HDKey` for BIP-32 hierarchical key derivation |
| `nostr-tools/nip06` | — | `accountFromSeedWords` — NIP-06 Nostr key derivation |
